                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Beware everybody! This is a terible scam. 4 minutes in and I'm already asking for refund (I was forced to play another minute to make a review, lol. 5minutes requirement:)). And I am not some picky player. It was just SO terrible already.\nMy experience in those 4 minutes.\nNo music. Sound almost absent expect few interactions which are ridiculously loud. It also seem inconsistent. Abysmal combat = enemies just run at you and through you and you just swing all around. No shielding, no tactic, no nothing.. in fact even no collisions at all. I don't even know if I hit them, there is no sound, no particles, no change in behavior in enemies, truely no nothing..and then they die in a moment of swinging in the air.\nWell.. I already spend more time writing this review than playing the \"game\". Just beware and do not buy this even for a $1. JUST NO\n\t\t",
